SGA version 1.0.0

It's the stream graph of Figure 3 of the Weighted, Bipartite, or Directed Stream Graphs
It's the same as Figure1_S, but with weights.
For that, you need to specify "weighted=true", and put a weight section at the end.

[general]
lifespan=(0 100)
time_scale=10
weighted=true

[events]
0 + N 0
0 + N 1
10 + N 3
10 + L 0 1
20 + L 1 3
30 - N 3
30 - L 0 1
30 - L 1 3
40 - N 1
40 + N 2
45 + L 0 2
50 + N 1
60 + L 1 2
70 + L 0 1
75 - L 0 2
80 - L 0 1
90 - N 2
90 - L 1 2
100 - N 0
100 - N 1

[weights]

[[nodes]]
type=universal
weight=0

[[links]]
type=lerp
0 1 ([10: 0, 13: 0.4, 16: 0, 20: -0.3, 22: 0, 26: 0.4, 30: 0] [70: 0, 75: 0.5, 80: 0])
1 3 ([20: 0, 23: 0.2, 27: 0.8, 30: 0])
0 2 ([45: 0, 48: 0.9, 52: 0.2, 58: 0.5, 63: 0.1, 70: 0.15, 75: 0])
1 2 ([60: 0, 63: 0.5, 70: -0.3, 75: 0.15, 82: -0.2, 90: 0])

[end]